<p>The regular service runs every four weeks, rather than once per calendar month. Choose the colours and number of bins you want cleaned in the booking form; you can include more than one bin of the same colour. Your selected service and total are shown before you confirm.</p>
<p>For shops, landlords and other businesses, see our <a href="/commercial-bin-cleaning/">commercial bin cleaning service</a> or call with your bin sizes and quantities for a confirmed price.</p>
